[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5745555404","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123641#issuecomment-5745555404","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123641","id":5745555404,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVnY3zA","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-19T21:50:49Z","updated_at":"2026-09-19T21:50:49Z","body":"It is a performant alternative to `get_path_to()`, which is already exposed.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5745555404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5748642331","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123641#issuecomment-5748642331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123641","id":5748642331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVqVSGw","user":{"login":"Spacexcx","id":175117217,"node_id":"U_kgDOCnAToQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175117217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx","html_url":"https://github.com/Spacexcx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-20T08:21:43Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T16:12:53Z","body":"In Node::_duplicate_scripts:\r\nNode *copy = instantiated ? p_copy->get_node(get_path_to_descendant(original)) : p_copy->get_child(i, false);\r\nCalling get_path_to_descendant(original) unqualified invokes it on this (the root node initiating the duplication).\r\nIn recursive calls for nested descendants, p_original and p_copy represent the current sub-tree rather than the root. Because this->get_path_to_descendant(original) returns the path relative to the root node (e.g. \"Child/GrandChild\"), calling p_copy->get_node(\"Child/GrandChild\") on Child's copy will fail to resolve the path and return nullptr, triggering:\r\nERR_FAIL_NULL_MSG(copy, \"Child node disappeared while duplicating.\");\r\nShould this be resolved relative to p_original instead?\r\np_copy->get_node(p_original->get_path_to_descendant(original))","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5748642331/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5750060294","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123641#issuecomment-5750060294","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123641","id":5750060294,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVrr1Bg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-20T13:20:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T13:20:50Z","body":"How does this compare to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111137 ?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5750060294/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5759354804","html_url":"https://github.c